   It doesn't count really how much gifts you get - it counts how much power...
   Let e.g. all the 'super-weapons' (Excalibur, Stormy, Mjollnir, Vorpal,
   Frost/Firebrand) gain their special abilities only after they are
   #invoked. Otherwise they are just normal weapons of their respective
   class. When you #invoke the artifact - it is the power of your God that 
   flows through it. So #invoke would be subject to similar restrictions
   as #pray - doesn't work if you try it too often (and if you really annoy
   Him - He'll take the gift away or use it against you...)

This is indeed a beautiful rules mechanic; you really have to consider
when you wake up the demon inside stormbringer or turn Mjollnir on.

And we all know what happens when you #invoke Stormy once too often...

